      "message": "It also has tests, so I\u0027d recommend to abandon this.\n\nNote there is a brief mention of this support here, we could probably mention it more:\nhttps://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/aidl/aidl-backends#dumpsys\n\n\nI have dreams of combining service/idlcli, and supporting arbitrary interactive AIDL commands over the commandline, but alas, as of now, this is a very crude tool.",
